    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "Admin can add, edit or delete Products from here.All created Products are listed here.The Products can edit through Edit link and remove through Trash link. Clicking on Add New to add new Product .We can upload images directly by clicking on the Set Featured Image link."
    },
